uDeCtzPtNkGDCqo2DDidK3_ZSog&oe=6B0C81A1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Musea: VR Art Museum", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**A museum that never runs out.**\n\nMusea is a virtual art museum where the galleries are only the beginning. Wander three handcrafted rooms hung with history's masterpieces, then type any artist or painting into the in-world search and watch a new exhibition assemble itself around you, drawn live from the world's public-domain collections.\n\n**Three resident galleries**\n\n- **The Grand Salon**: a monumental hall of European masters, from Leonardo to Van Gogh, with Raphael's *School of Athens* commanding its own wall\n- **The Focused Exhibit**: Impressionism and modern visions, from Monet's light to Seurat's Sunday afternoon\n- **The Vault**: an intimate jewel box of Japanese masterworks, home to Hokusai's *Great Wave*\n\n**Infinite exhibitions**\n\nSearch all of art history. If it's in the public domain, you can hang it: verified, attributed, and rendered at museum resolution on your walls.\n\n**Every work, up close**\n\nStep in to inspect brushwork at full resolution. Read the story behind each piece on gallery wall text, just like the real thing.\n\n**A soundtrack to match**\n\nClassical works fill the halls, opening with Vivaldi's Four Seasons.\n\nNo tickets. No crowds. No closing time. Just you and five centuries of painting.", "short_description": "Step into a museum with no walls on its collection. Wander three grand galleries hung with masterpieces, then search all of art history and hang public-domain works in your own exhibition, drawn live from the world's collections."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://happyfire-engine.dev/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HappyFire Engine LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://happyfire-engine.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SO